Source of the legal text

The text of the laws in this repository is published by the People's Assembly of Gagauzia (Народное Собрание
Гагаузии / Gagauziyanın Halk Topluşu) at https://halktoplushu.md, page "Законы АТО Гагаузия (Гагауз-Ери)"
(https://halktoplushu.md/normativnaya-baza/zakony-ato-gagauziya-gagauz-eri), read on 2026-10-30.

Source: Народное Собрание Гагаузии (Halk Topluşu), https://halktoplushu.md.

The site's footer reads: "© Все права защищены. При использовании материалов сайта ссылка на источник обязательна."
("© All rights reserved. When the site's materials are used, a link to the source is required.") The site states no
other terms. This repository gives that link above, in README.md, and in every commit that adds a law. Under the
Law of the Republic of Moldova No. 139/2010 on copyright and related rights (article 8), official documents of a
legislative character are not objects of copyright.

This is not an official publication. Only the laws as published in the official bulletin of Gagauzia are
authoritative.

Everything else in this repository (the history as commits, the commit messages, the tables and the tools) is
dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode
